---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: "What is EcoRouter?",
    a: "An open-source TypeScript SDK for autonomous agents to discover, evaluate, and settle HTTP 402 capability fees in-process."
  },
  {
    q: "How does provider selection work?",
    a: "When execute() is invoked, EcoRouter queries registered providers in parallel, filters out quotes exceeding your maxSpendUsdc policy, and routes to the lowest-cost endpoint."
  },
  {
    q: "Is there a centralized proxy or server?",
    a: "No. The SDK runs completely in your application process. Your keys, policies, and queries are strictly local."
  },
  {
    q: "How does it protect against runaway loops?",
    a: "Every execution requires an explicit spending policy. If quoted fees exceed your limit, EcoRouter rejects the call before initiating any payment."
  }
];
---

<section id="faq" class="py-16 md:py-24 relative bg-white border-t border-[#D8D8D3]">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-2 text-center">
      <div class="text-[10.5px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#888883] font-medium">
        04 // FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#111111]">
        FAQ
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Flat Accordion List Separated by Thin Borders -->
    <div class="border-y border-[#D8D8D3] divide-y divide-[#D8D8D3]">
      {faqs.map((item) => (
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none select-none text-sm font-medium text-[#111111] hover:text-[#4F4F4A] transition-colors">
            <span>{item.q}</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#888883] group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform duration-150">
              ＋
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="pt-2.5 text-xs text-[#4F4F4A] leading-relaxed">
            {item.a}
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
